// B1 course (A2 → B1 roadmap), module 7 „Tervis ja enesetunne” (a2b1-031…035), stage B1-. Lesson template v4
// (docs/COURSE_DESIGN_COMMUNICATIVE.md §12, docs/METHODOLOGY_STANDARD.md). One storyline: an autumn flu wave in Sofia's
// office (Liis, Markus, Anna) and in Jaan's family (Kadri, Mia, Oskar, grandmother Helgi), Viktor's cycling injury.
// Goal, said on the first sheet: the office's challenge „30 päeva tervemalt” — at the end the learner reports the
// results and advises a new colleague (034 Kasuta).
//   031 Anna falls ill at the office (picture), Mia's flu in Jaan's family chat, flu or a cold?; Kasuta: the sick-leave
//       call to the boss Liis and a hand-over mail to Sofia.
//   032 Markus at the pharmacy with his e-prescription (picture: his doctor's visit), the medicine leaflet; Viktor falls
//       off his bike — where to turn (112, 1220, traumapunkt, apteek), a pharmacy role play; Kasuta: the call to the
//       advice line 1220 (listening), a 1220 role play, a mail to the family doctor.
//   033 Kadri's note to Oskar and grandmother (sina / teie commands), a radio doctor on the flu; Viktor's physiotherapy
//       sheet, Sofia's back; Kasuta: Markus cannot sleep (picture) — Anna's advice, a two-week plan, a letter.
//   034 the challenge starts — four cards, Liis's invitation (picture: Jaan's habits); two weeks later (listening),
//       what helps a habit last; Kasuta: the results, a talk at the meeting, advice to the new colleague Kristjan.
// B1 grammar added here (METHODOLOGY_STANDARD §7): the translative of change — jäin haigeks, sain terveks, läks
// paremaks, muutus punaseks (jääma / saama / minema / muutuma + -ks), against the state (olen haige, tunnen end
// nõrgana). Taught in 031 (notice, table, sort; forms, cards, cloze; the call and the mail), met again in 032 (põlv
// läks paksuks, valu muutus tugevamaks), 033 (kui palavik läheb kõrgeks, tee tuba jahedaks) and 034 (uni muutus
// paremaks, the results). Module 6's food and service words come back on purpose (pudel, pakk, tass, supp,
// magustoit, kohvik, tellima, maksma, soovitama, maitsev, tükk, liiter, allergia). Lesson 5 is the module's mini Harno
// A2 exam (unchanged). The v3 file is in archive/v3/b1/module07.js, the v1 file in archive/v1/b1/module07.js.
